            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0541" n="421" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg421"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">813.00 Tacoma/–: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ministers in Honduras,
                            Nicaragua, and Salvador to the Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">On Board
                            the</hi>
                        <placeName>U. S. S. “<hi rendition="#small-caps">Tacoma</hi>”</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1922-08-20T22:00:00-06:00"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">August 20, 1922—10
                        p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received August 24—10:30 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>After full discussion conference this afternoon agreed to and signed convention
                    of preamble and eight articles.</p>
                <p>[Here follows a summary of the agreement, the signed text of which is printed <hi
                        rendition="#italic">infra.</hi>]</p>
                <p>The treaty was signed by the three Presidents, the three Ministers for Foreign
                    Affairs and by the three American Ministers as witnesses. The Legation in
                    Tegucigalpa is forwarding full text and translation by next mail. The
                    invitations to adhere were sent out <pb facs="0542" n="422" xml:id="pg422"/> by
                    wireless to-day to Guatemala and Costa Rica and a telegram of thanks for the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Tacoma</hi> was sent to President Harding signed by the
                    three Presidents.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morales</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ramer</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schuyler</hi></item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
